1
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:34,710
Ms Xu.

2
00:00:37,310 --> 00:00:38,510
I'm sorry

3
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:40,750
you had to go through such a scare

4
00:00:41,150 --> 00:00:42,550
right after coming home.

5
00:00:49,130 --> 00:00:51,680
[Eclipse in the Lost City]
[Episode 18]

6
00:00:59,630 --> 00:01:01,360
Why don't you take a look first?

7
00:01:14,870 --> 00:01:16,110
She is trustworthy.

8
00:01:16,950 --> 00:01:18,810
It is indeed Lu Ye's handwriting.

9
00:01:19,430 --> 00:01:21,470
It's as ugly as ever.

10
00:01:22,950 --> 00:01:24,280
He really does know you.

11
00:01:26,530 --> 00:01:28,039
Lu Ye wants Xu Qingdao dead.

12
00:01:28,039 --> 00:01:28,840
And so do I.

13
00:01:28,960 --> 00:01:29,760
In that case,

14
00:01:29,789 --> 00:01:31,120
why don't we cooperate?

15
00:01:31,510 --> 00:01:33,229
Whatever you want to do
is none of my business.

16
00:01:33,229 --> 00:01:34,750
Anyway, once it's done,

17
00:01:34,750 --> 00:01:36,310
the Shisha Gang is mine.

18
00:01:36,470 --> 00:01:37,729
Nothing else matters.

19
00:01:38,360 --> 00:01:39,560
Why does he trust you?

20
00:01:42,950 --> 00:01:44,350
After everything I said,

21
00:01:44,630 --> 00:01:46,160
is this what you want to ask?

22
00:01:50,070 --> 00:01:51,750
The new lead is at Renji Hospital.

23
00:01:51,750 --> 00:01:53,670
Whether you go is up to you.

24
00:02:16,630 --> 00:02:18,590
It healed that quickly?

25
00:02:50,710 --> 00:02:51,950
Boss, this is bad!

26
00:02:51,950 --> 00:02:53,790
Tianbai's condition has gotten worse!

27
00:02:53,790 --> 00:02:55,650
Take him to the hospital quickly!

28
00:02:57,810 --> 00:03:00,210
[Renji Hospital]

29
00:03:06,390 --> 00:03:07,650
It's nothing serious.

30
00:03:07,670 --> 00:03:09,310
He might run a fever for a few days.

31
00:03:08,310 --> 00:03:11,420
[Director of Renji Hospital]

32
00:03:09,390 --> 00:03:10,750
He needs plenty of rest,

33
00:03:10,950 --> 00:03:12,590
or it could weaken his constitution.

34
00:03:12,590 --> 00:03:14,630
It's normal for it to flare up
from time to time.

35
00:03:14,630 --> 00:03:18,110
After all, most people couldn't
handle something like that.

36
00:03:18,910 --> 00:03:20,310
Compared to most people,

37
00:03:20,510 --> 00:03:23,790
he's actually handling it very well.

38
00:03:24,670 --> 00:03:27,110
That's very thoughtful of you, Chief Xu.

39
00:03:28,310 --> 00:03:30,230
This kid's got one tough life.

40
00:03:30,510 --> 00:03:32,640
Still, it can't have been easy for him.

41
00:03:33,150 --> 00:03:34,350
I'll go check on him.

42
00:03:35,870 --> 00:03:36,670
Dad.

43
00:03:38,550 --> 00:03:39,550
Let me go instead.

44
00:03:40,390 --> 00:03:42,650
I'd like to take care of him for a while.

45
00:03:43,670 --> 00:03:44,870
Okay, Yin.

46
00:03:45,550 --> 00:03:47,150
I'll leave him in your hands.

47
00:03:48,740 --> 00:03:49,380
Please.

48
00:03:52,400 --> 00:03:54,720
Our current experimental data

49
00:03:55,710 --> 00:03:56,990
still needs some...

50
00:04:21,230 --> 00:04:22,029
It's okay.

51
00:04:22,670 --> 00:04:23,470
It's fine.

52
00:04:27,270 --> 00:04:29,030
Easy. It's me.

53
00:04:35,630 --> 00:04:36,190
I...

54
00:04:36,470 --> 00:04:37,270
You're awake?

55
00:04:39,650 --> 00:04:41,050
Can you let me go now?

56
00:04:43,360 --> 00:04:44,159
Sorry.

57
00:04:45,530 --> 00:04:46,530
Don't mention it.

58
00:04:46,830 --> 00:04:48,230
I'm always happy to help,

59
00:04:48,350 --> 00:04:49,030
right?

60
00:04:53,159 --> 00:04:54,080
You...

61
00:05:06,220 --> 00:05:06,820
Are you...

62
00:05:06,830 --> 00:05:08,030
Are you badly hurt?

63
00:05:08,350 --> 00:05:09,350
Did I do this?

64
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:10,070
I'm sorry. I...

65
00:05:10,070 --> 00:05:10,870
I'm fine.

66
00:05:11,150 --> 00:05:14,910
I checked myself into the hospital
so I could move around more easily.

67
00:05:14,910 --> 00:05:16,990
But Officer Shen,

68
00:05:17,030 --> 00:05:18,890
you already owe me several meals.

69
00:05:19,030 --> 00:05:20,430
Don't try to get out of it.

70
00:05:20,950 --> 00:05:21,750
Okay.

71
00:05:23,310 --> 00:05:24,310
But...

72
00:05:24,470 --> 00:05:27,990
we really need to figure out
why you lost control.

73
00:05:37,110 --> 00:05:38,370
The maintenance dose.

74
00:05:39,310 --> 00:05:40,790
I suspect something was wrong
with the maintenance dose

75
00:05:40,790 --> 00:05:42,290
Xu Qingdao injected me with.

76
00:05:42,290 --> 00:05:44,150
It wasn't the same type as before.

77
00:05:48,990 --> 00:05:50,990
He probably came to the hospital, too.

78
00:05:50,990 --> 00:05:52,030
Be careful.

79
00:05:52,750 --> 00:05:53,670
Don't worry.

80
00:05:53,870 --> 00:05:55,110
I had Xu Yin keep him away.

81
00:05:55,110 --> 00:05:55,590
We...

82
00:05:55,590 --> 00:05:56,790
You really trust her.

83
00:05:57,470 --> 00:05:58,070
Who?

84
00:05:58,070 --> 00:05:58,880
Xu Yin.

85
00:06:00,830 --> 00:06:01,460
Of course.

86
00:06:09,270 --> 00:06:10,470
I almost forgot the important part.

87
00:06:10,470 --> 00:06:13,030
The new lead has something to do
with this hospital's director.

88
00:06:13,030 --> 00:06:14,910
We have a Qingtian Gang informant here.

89
00:06:14,910 --> 00:06:15,770
He gave me this.

90
00:06:21,930 --> 00:06:24,390
[S-03 has been activated. Attached is
this month's S-02 failed-case report.]

91
00:06:21,930 --> 00:06:24,390
[Sample X has also exhibited an anomaly
similar to last month's case.]

92
00:06:34,810 --> 00:06:37,010
The director is connected to Wolfbane.

93
00:06:41,630 --> 00:06:42,430
Dad.

94
00:06:44,190 --> 00:06:44,990
Yin.

95
00:06:45,430 --> 00:06:46,390
Why are you here?

96
00:06:47,790 --> 00:06:49,470
I just went to get the medicine.

97
00:06:49,470 --> 00:06:50,130
Dad.

98
00:06:50,430 --> 00:06:51,790
Why are you back?

99
00:06:54,470 --> 00:06:56,110
You left this in the car.

100
00:06:56,470 --> 00:06:57,530
It's cold at night.

101
00:06:57,850 --> 00:06:58,580
Put this on.

102
00:07:05,190 --> 00:07:05,990
Thank you.

103
00:07:06,270 --> 00:07:07,150
Since I'm here,

104
00:07:07,430 --> 00:07:09,360
I'll go see Tianbai before I leave.

105
00:07:27,780 --> 00:07:28,640
By the way, Dad,

106
00:07:30,430 --> 00:07:31,710
did you forget this?

107
00:07:33,870 --> 00:07:34,870
There it is.

108
00:07:35,790 --> 00:07:36,590
Yin，

109
00:07:37,230 --> 00:07:38,750
don't just focus on taking care of him.

110
00:07:38,750 --> 00:07:40,080
Get some rest yourself.

111
00:07:41,290 --> 00:07:42,050
Yes, Father.

112
00:07:42,350 --> 00:07:43,550
I'll get going, then.

113
00:07:48,770 --> 00:07:50,010
The old geezer

114
00:07:50,350 --> 00:07:52,080
came back just to check up on me.

115
00:07:52,870 --> 00:07:53,909
He's gone.

116
00:08:00,150 --> 00:08:00,950
Lu Ye?

117
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:06,760
My leg...

118
00:08:09,330 --> 00:08:10,530
My leg is numb.

119
00:08:10,630 --> 00:08:11,390
Help me.

120
00:08:17,630 --> 00:08:19,590
Since when did you get so weak?

121
00:08:21,350 --> 00:08:23,310
You'll know when you reach my age.

122
00:08:26,550 --> 00:08:27,830
He is your sworn enemy?

123
00:08:29,580 --> 00:08:30,540
What do you want to do?

124
00:08:30,540 --> 00:08:32,580
Can we trust a cop?

125
00:08:36,230 --> 00:08:38,030
If you want to cooperate with me,

126
00:08:38,190 --> 00:08:39,390
you have to trust him.

127
00:08:40,110 --> 00:08:42,309
I know exactly what kind of person he is.

128
00:08:45,790 --> 00:08:46,590
Fair enough.

129
00:08:47,230 --> 00:08:48,670
After all, someone used to say that word

130
00:08:48,670 --> 00:08:50,030
all the time when he was abroad.

131
00:08:50,030 --> 00:08:50,890
Don't tell him.

132
00:08:52,510 --> 00:08:54,240
That depends on how you behave.

133
00:08:54,550 --> 00:08:55,430
Don't tell him.

134
00:08:55,580 --> 00:08:56,980
Alright, I promise you.

135
00:08:57,870 --> 00:08:59,670
Wipe your face clean first.

136
00:09:05,390 --> 00:09:06,190
What's wrong?

137
00:09:06,730 --> 00:09:07,660
Did I miss a spot?

138
00:09:13,070 --> 00:09:15,390
Miss Xu, we have things to do.
We'll get going.

139
00:09:15,390 --> 00:09:16,250
Suit yourself.

140
00:09:16,910 --> 00:09:18,040
Where are you going?

141
00:09:20,470 --> 00:09:21,400
To find someone.

142
00:09:27,830 --> 00:09:28,510
Why?

143
00:09:29,350 --> 00:09:30,150
What?

144
00:09:30,910 --> 00:09:33,710
You kept testing me
before you finally trusted me.

145
00:09:33,950 --> 00:09:35,820
Xu Yin is Xu Qingdao's daughter,

146
00:09:35,990 --> 00:09:37,390
yet you trust her so much.

147
00:09:38,750 --> 00:09:39,880
Didn't she tell you?

148
00:09:40,550 --> 00:09:41,570
Tell me what?

149
00:09:41,630 --> 00:09:42,760
Your relationship?

150
00:09:43,790 --> 00:09:44,470
Yes.

151
00:09:44,550 --> 00:09:46,150
We went to college together.

152
00:09:48,400 --> 00:09:49,240
Don't worry.

153
00:09:49,340 --> 00:09:51,140
She absolutely hates Xu Qingdao

154
00:09:51,230 --> 00:09:54,090
because he was responsible
for her mother's death.

155
00:09:57,510 --> 00:09:58,550
I see.

156
00:09:59,750 --> 00:10:02,030
You guys are all so cautious.

157
00:10:02,710 --> 00:10:03,470
I have to say,

158
00:10:03,910 --> 00:10:04,950
you two are quite a match.

159
00:10:04,950 --> 00:10:06,770
No wonder Xu Qingdao wanted
to set you two up.

160
00:10:06,770 --> 00:10:07,410
Shut up.
